    <title>Five questions for an access log, answered from the shell</title>
    <link href="https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/</id>
    <published>2026-11-27T00:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2026-11-27T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <author><name>LynxDB team</name></author>
    <category term="Using LynxDB"/>
    <summary>lynxdb query loads a log file, runs one PPL query over it and exits, with no server to start. We ask a 1,000-line access log where its server errors come from and when they happened.</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Something breaks, and the evidence is a log file on a host. This post asks such a file five questions with &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;lynxdb query&lt;/code&gt;, the pipe mode of &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/lynxbase/lynxdb&quot;&gt;LynxDB&lt;/a&gt;: it loads the file, runs one &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.lynxdb.org/docs/ppl/overview&quot;&gt;PPL&lt;/a&gt; query over it and prints the result. Every command below was run with LynxDB 26.11.1.896, and every output is what it printed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-file&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#the-file&quot;&gt;The file&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;access.log&lt;/code&gt; is test data from the LynxDB repository&lt;sup class=&quot;fn-ref&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#fn1&quot; id=&quot;fnref1&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;notes-title&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;: 1,000 requests to five hosts, one per line, a timestamp followed by &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;key=value&lt;/code&gt; pairs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;head&lt;/span&gt; -n 2 access.log&lt;/span&gt;
2025-01-15T08:00:00.105Z host=web-03 level=ERROR method=GET path=/api/v1/users status=502 user=grace response_time=786 bytes=32228 msg=&amp;quot;GET /api/v1/users completed&amp;quot;
2025-01-15T08:00:00.543Z host=api-02 level=ERROR method=DELETE path=/api/v1/search status=502 user=grace response_time=462 bytes=46701 msg=&amp;quot;DELETE /api/v1/search completed&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no schema to declare. LynxDB reads the timestamp into &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;_time&lt;/code&gt; and each &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;key=value&lt;/code&gt; pair into a field when the query runs, so &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;status&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;response_time&lt;/code&gt; compare as numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;how-many-events-over-what-time&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#how-many-events-over-what-time&quot;&gt;How many events, over what time&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;lynxdb&lt;/span&gt; query --file access.log --no-stats &#92;
    &lt;span class=&quot;t-q&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;stats&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; events&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;_time&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; first&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;max&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;_time&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; last&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-table&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;┌────────┬───────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; events &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; first                             &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; last                              &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;├────────┼───────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;  1,000 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:00:00.105 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:08:19.524 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;└────────┴───────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;(1 row)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A thousand events in eight minutes and twenty seconds, from 08:00:00 to 08:08:19 UTC on 15 January 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;callout callout--note&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;callout__label&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;callout__body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;--file&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;lynxdb query&lt;/code&gt; needs no server. It loads the file into a temporary index named &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;, runs the query and exits. A query that names no &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;source&lt;/code&gt; reads &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;, so the queries in this post start straight with a command.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;which-levels&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#which-levels&quot;&gt;Which levels&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Without &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;--no-stats&lt;/code&gt;, the CLI prints a footer under the table: the rows returned, the time the query took and the events it scanned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;lynxdb&lt;/span&gt; query --file access.log &lt;span class=&quot;t-q&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;stats&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;by&lt;/span&gt; level&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-table&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;┌─────────┬───────┐&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; count() &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; level &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;├─────────┼───────┤&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     294 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; ERROR &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     359 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; INFO  &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     347 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; WARN  &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;└─────────┴───────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;(3 rows)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;───&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;Rows&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;Took&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;b&gt;27ms&lt;/b&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;Scanned&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;b&gt;1,000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The time is from an Apple M4 Pro laptop. The rest of this post passes &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;--no-stats&lt;/code&gt; to keep the outputs short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;where-the-server-errors-are&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#where-the-server-errors-are&quot;&gt;Where the server errors are&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;204 of the 1,000 requests ended with a status of 500 or more. Three queries narrow them down.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;by-host&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#by-host&quot;&gt;By host&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;eval&lt;/code&gt; adds a field to every event. Here &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;error&lt;/code&gt; is 1 for a server error and 0 otherwise, so one &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;stats&lt;/code&gt; counts the requests and the errors of each host together. A query this long reads better kept in a file, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;errors-by-host.ppl&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code&quot; data-lang=&quot;ppl&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;PPL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-ppl&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;eval&lt;/span&gt; error &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;status &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;token pipe&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;stats&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; requests&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;sum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;error&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; errors &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;by&lt;/span&gt; host
&lt;span class=&quot;token pipe&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;eval&lt;/span&gt; pct &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;round&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;errors &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;100.0&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; requests&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;token pipe&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;sort&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; pct&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;lynxdb&lt;/span&gt; query --file access.log --no-stats &lt;span class=&quot;t-s&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;$(cat errors-by-host.ppl)&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-table&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;┌────────┬────────┬──────┬──────────┐&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; host   &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; errors &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; pct  &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; requests &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;├────────┼────────┼──────┼──────────┤&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; api-02 &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     48 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt; 22.6 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      212 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; web-02 &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     43 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt; 22.3 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      193 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; web-03 &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     41 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt; 21.1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      194 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; web-01 &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     38 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt; 19.7 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      193 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; api-01 &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;     34 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt; 16.3 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      208 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;└────────┴────────┴──────┴──────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;(5 rows)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No host stands out: api-02 fails 22.6% of its requests and api-01, the best, 16.3%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;which-paths&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#which-paths&quot;&gt;Which paths&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;lynxdb&lt;/span&gt; query --file access.log --no-stats &lt;span class=&quot;t-q&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;where&lt;/span&gt; status &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;500&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token pipe&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;top&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; path&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-table&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;┌───────┬────────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; count &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; path           &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;├───────┼────────────────┤&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;    28 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; /api/v1/users  &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;    27 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; /api/v1/orders &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;    25 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; /api/v1/health &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;└───────┴────────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;(3 rows)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;top&lt;/code&gt; counts the values of a field and keeps the most common. The users, orders and health endpoints lead with 25 to 28 errors each, close together again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;when&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#when&quot;&gt;When&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;lynxdb&lt;/span&gt; query --file access.log --no-stats &#92;
    &lt;span class=&quot;t-q&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;where&lt;/span&gt; status &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;500&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token pipe&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;timechart&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;span&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;1m&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-table&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;┌───────────────────────────────┬─────────┐&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; _time                         &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt; count() &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;├───────────────────────────────┼─────────┤&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:00:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      20 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:01:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      23 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:02:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      23 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:03:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      25 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:04:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      28 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:05:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      24 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:06:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      26 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:07:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      23 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt; 2025-01-15 08:08:00 +0000 UTC &lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-n&quot;&gt;      12 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;└───────────────────────────────┴─────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;t-d&quot;&gt;(9 rows)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set against all requests per minute (&lt;code&gt;timechart span=1m count()&lt;/code&gt; without the &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;where&lt;/code&gt;), the errors hold steady: 20 to 28 of the 120 requests in every full minute. Nothing spikes, so the cause is not one bad minute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;figure&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;figure__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/errors-per-minute.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Requests per minute in access.log, split into server errors and other statuses&quot; width=&quot;480&quot; height=&quot;293&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; data-theme-image=&quot;light&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Requests per minute in access.log: server errors on the baseline, the other statuses above them. The file ends at 08:08:19, so the last minute holds 40 requests.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;from-standard-input&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#from-standard-input&quot;&gt;From standard input&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;--file -&lt;/code&gt; reads standard input, so the log can come out of another command: &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;kubectl logs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;journalctl&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;ssh&lt;/code&gt; to the host. A result of one value prints as the bare value, ready for a shell variable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;console&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-console&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-p&quot;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;t-cmd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;cat&lt;/span&gt; access.log | &lt;span class=&quot;t-c&quot;&gt;lynxdb&lt;/span&gt; query --file - --no-stats &#92;
    &lt;span class=&quot;t-q&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;where&lt;/span&gt; status &lt;span class=&quot;token operator&quot;&gt;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token number&quot;&gt;500&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token pipe&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;stats&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token function&quot;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token punctuation&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;token keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; errors&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
204&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The help text puts the whole of pipe mode in three sentences:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;pull-quote&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run a PPL query against a LynxDB server, or with --file against local files. --file - reads standard input. Local input is loaded into the index main, and a local query that names no source reads main.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;figcaption class=&quot;pull-quote__by&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;lynxdb query --help&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;callout callout--tip&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;callout__label&quot;&gt;Tip&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;callout__body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When its output goes to a pipe instead of a terminal, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;lynxdb query&lt;/code&gt; writes one JSON object per line, ready for &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;--format&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;-F&lt;/code&gt;) picks another format: &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;table&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;csv&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;tsv&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;markdown&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;json&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;raw&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-commands-in-this-post&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#the-commands-in-this-post&quot;&gt;The commands in this post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;table-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;PPL command&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;What it did here&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;stats&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Counted events, overall or per value of a field (&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;by level&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;by host&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;where&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Kept the events that match a condition (&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;status &amp;gt;= 500&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;eval&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Added a field to every event, computed from the others&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;sort&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Ordered the rows; &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;- pct&lt;/code&gt; sorts by &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;pct&lt;/code&gt;, highest first&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;top&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Listed the most common values of a field with their counts&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;timechart&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Counted events per time bucket (&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;span=1m&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.lynxdb.org/docs/ppl/overview&quot;&gt;PPL guide&lt;/a&gt; covers the other commands and every function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;keeping-the-log-on-a-server&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;heading-link&quot; href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#keeping-the-log-on-a-server&quot;&gt;Keeping the log on a server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipe mode reads the file again for every query. To search the same events later, or logs from many hosts, load them into &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;lynxdb server&lt;/code&gt; and run the same PPL against the stored index:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;code code--term&quot; data-lang=&quot;shell&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;code__bar&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;code__dots&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 46 10&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;5&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;23&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;41&quot; cy=&quot;5&quot; r=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/circle&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code__lang&quot;&gt;Shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;code__pre&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-shell&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token comment&quot;&gt;# in one terminal&lt;/span&gt;
lynxdb server
&lt;span class=&quot;token comment&quot;&gt;# in another&lt;/span&gt;
lynxdb ingest access.log &lt;span class=&quot;token parameter variable&quot;&gt;--index&lt;/span&gt; web
lynxdb query &lt;span class=&quot;token string&quot;&gt;&#39;source=web | where status &gt;= 500 | top 3 path&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;figure&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;figure__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/web-ui.png&quot; alt=&quot;The search page of lynxdb server with the query source=web, where status &amp;gt;= 500 and a histogram of the matches&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; height=&quot;498&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; data-theme-image=&quot;light&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;The Web UI section of lynxdb.org draws the search page of &lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;lynxdb server&lt;/code&gt; on this file: 169 of the 840 events from 08:00 to 08:07 have a status of 500 or more.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.lynxdb.org/docs/getting-started/server-mode&quot;&gt;server mode guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;footnotes&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;notes-title&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;footnotes__title&quot; id=&quot;notes-title&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;footnotes__list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;fn1&quot; class=&quot;footnote-item&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The file is &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/lynxbase/lynxdb/blob/main/testdata/logs/access.log&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;nowrap&quot;&gt;testdata/logs/access.log&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in the LynxDB repository. Clone the repository to run the commands as they are, or point them at a log of your own. &lt;a href=&quot;https://lynxdb.org/blog/querying-an-access-log/#fnref1&quot; class=&quot;fn-back&quot; aria-label=&quot;Back to the text&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 12 12&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M6 10V2.5M2.5 6 6 2.5 9.5 6&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
